---
// Illustrative reconstruction, not the shipped UI and not real eval data.
---

<div class="demo demo-trust" data-seq data-cycle="13000" role="img" aria-label="Illustration: the same IT question answered by a generic web-and-LLM answer and by Copilot grounded in trusted sources, then scored by an evaluation rubric.">
  <div class="q" data-step data-at="200">
    <span class="who">IT admin</span> How do I block personal accounts on our company laptops?
  </div>
  <div class="cols">
    <div class="col">
      <div class="col-head">search + generic LLM</div>
      <div class="answer" data-step data-at="1400">
        <p>Try this registry edit. A forum thread says it works on most versions.</p>
        <span class="src weak">forum · 2019</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric" data-step data-at="5600"><span class="bad">grounded</span><span class="bad">cited</span><span class="bad">safe to act on</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col good">
      <div class="col-head">copilot, grounded</div>
      <div class="answer" data-step data-at="2800">
        <p>Set it as a device policy so it covers every managed laptop.<sup>1</sup> Pilot it on one group first.<sup>2</sup></p>
        <span class="src">1 · official docs</span><span class="src">2 · your IT guidance</span>
      </div>
      <div class="rubric" data-step data-at="7200"><span class="ok">grounded</span><span class="ok">cited</span><span class="ok">safe to act on</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="judge" data-step data-at="9000">
    <span class="mono">llm judge</span> calibrated to expert graders, gates the release
  </div>
  <span class="illustration-tag">illustration</span>
</div>

<style>
  .demo-trust {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2.2cqh;
    padding: 4.5cqh 4.5cqw 5.5cqh;
    font-size: clamp(9px, 2.2cqw, 18px);
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--ink);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 85% 10%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 18%, transparent), transparent 45%),
      var(--bg-soft);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .q {
    padding: 0.7em 0.9em;
    border-radius: 0.8em;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .who {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    margin-right: 0.4em;
  }

  .cols {
    flex: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1em;
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6em;
    padding: 0.8em 0.9em;
    border-radius: 0.9em;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 70%, transparent);
  }

  .col.good {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 50%, var(--line));
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .col-head {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .good .col-head {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
  }

  .answer p {
    margin: 0 0 0.5em;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .answer sup {
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .src {
    display: inline-block;
    margin: 0.2em 0.3em 0 0;
    padding: 0.15em 0.6em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85em;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .src.weak {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .rubric {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.3em;
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 0.5em;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }

  .rubric span {
    padding: 0.1em 0.55em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .rubric span::before {
    margin-right: 0.3em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .rubric .ok::before {
    content: '✓';
    color: var(--good);
  }

  .rubric .bad::before {
    content: '✕';
    color: #c2412d;
  }

  .judge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    max-width: calc(100% - 7em);
    padding: 0.6em 0.9em;
    border-radius: 0.8em;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--bg);
  }

  .judge .mono {
    font-size: 0.9em;
    margin-right: 0.5em;
    color: var(--highlight);
  }
</style>
